{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_8000_situation", "source_sha256": "df7e905582089f19789355d95376536c02e33291bec3890e35ab61b7a6d69c3a", "ja": "グラビアのお仕事　撮影前", "zh": "写真拍摄工作　拍摄前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_8000_place", "source_sha256": "8e8559b34e492b7c5ab25f94a298af6a4d51648308781f8ea2b669321f3177dd", "ja": "ダイニングバー", "zh": "餐酒吧", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_8001_p", "source_sha256": "13a55d8e52ac1495dc24ab8f99ca2542747bf832ee54c6c905ed4a5d62babab8", "ja": "（今日はアイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』の新企画。\n春香が『バーテンダー』に扮し、撮影へ挑む）", "zh": "（今天是偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的新企划。\n春香要扮演“调酒师”，接受拍摄挑战。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_8002_001har", "source_sha256": "618f98bee5a8cf6c93c4da97534fb92d22128fe40fd5ebd6b82a52d89f2c7fa3", "ja": "わぁ、大人っぽい場所ですね。\nバーってこんな雰囲気なんだ……。", "zh": "哇，这地方真有大人的感觉。\n酒吧原来是这种氛围啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_8003_p", "source_sha256": "522e154868804009a92e21a8efbe99a7cd416b96199c9ea36de731b423add09b", "ja": "まあ、高校生にはピンとこない場所だよな。\n大丈夫か？　緊張とか……。", "zh": "不过对高中生来说，确实是个没什么实感的地方吧。\n还好吗？紧不紧张……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_8004_001har", "source_sha256": "119187a33538c3e7420652d576afe633de5409907afd7f7d7999666bcae23c50", "ja": "はい！　緊張は大丈夫……なんですけど、バーテンダー\nとして、そもそもどう振舞うといいのかなあって……。", "zh": "是！紧张倒是没问题……不过，我在想，作为调酒师，到底该怎么表现才好呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_8005_001har", "source_sha256": "d34dfda45bae416fa371676026f734cffa3270e28b1068df0e32333c188d054b", "ja": "ちなみに{$P$}さんは、\nこういうお店って、よく来るんですか？", "zh": "顺便问一下，{$P$}先生经常来这种店吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_8006_p", "source_sha256": "536a87c3ecab4bf8af084b389d8c64690dfb8cab2dded12329201089b147ccfe", "ja": "まあ、よくってことはないけど、\nたまに立ち寄ることはあるよ。", "zh": "嗯，也不能说经常来，不过偶尔会顺路来一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_8007_001har", "source_sha256": "c8cf667acdaa4350ecdb13c9cd2f13357048187de4770bee16d062ffa89a2d64", "ja": "そうなんですね。そしたら、\n教えてください、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "原来是这样。那就请告诉我，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_8008_001har", "source_sha256": "6e503f0bb1afa95a3d076effb77ed11b69b659a8e9b81058701b881da3470ace", "ja": "バーにはどんなことを求めて行くんですか？\nバーテンダー役の参考に、聞かせてほしいです！", "zh": "去酒吧时，您会期待些什么呢？\n为了给酒保这个角色作参考，请告诉我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_8009", "source_sha256": "69af22a0f4a20536196767d3bf0e418cc75b1cd454d709438a001b7fb4f3f615", "ja": "コミュニケーション", "zh": "沟通", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_8010", "source_sha256": "e94e7b2b10025ced72762766b28706cf87acaf883945c90ecd87426e8e6c17ff", "ja": "静かな時間", "zh": "宁静的时光", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_8011", "source_sha256": "dd03a02d17ca942b87038c31bcf66e1b8e21b79551f0bb7bedd4acc3232cb665", "ja": "羽目を外す", "zh": "放纵一下", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_8100_p", "source_sha256": "f6f5afc1b9d1a948f7c1e234eb34bd612e3fa63f74d4855c84c2079368d2134c", "ja": "バーテンダーとのコミュニケーションかな？\n話上手な人も多いし、楽しい時間が過ごせるんだよ。", "zh": "是和调酒师交流吗？\n他们中有很多都很健谈，能让人度过一段愉快的时光。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_8101_001har", "source_sha256": "4ae14794dd3b450c97b1dc9c4705cd85a146086b6ec769217672dfdc54be76b8", "ja": "なるほど！　飲み物を作るだけじゃなくて、\nお客さんとのお話も大切なんですね！", "zh": "原来如此！不仅要调制饮品，\n和客人聊天也很重要呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_8102_001har", "source_sha256": "565ee571d868d26b141783ee69247f9c4fe7f182950855f6955c139f72c4d564", "ja": "でも、それなら得意です！　誰かと話すの好きなので。\n意外とバーテンダーに向いてるかも……えへへっ♪", "zh": "不过，那我就擅长了！因为我喜欢和别人聊天。\n说不定我意外地很适合当调酒师……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_8200_p", "source_sha256": "6270bb5fea43d922939f4ae4d9bd844d95fc76c4108c1e23f146144df857900d", "ja": "静かな時間を求めて、かな？　お店の雰囲気に\n合わせて、ゆっくり過ごすのも楽しいよ。", "zh": "是为了寻求安静的时光吧？配合店里的氛围，慢慢享受也很有意思哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_8201_001har", "source_sha256": "17803294609e712143ecada6c02fcb7594152d2fcefc5eecd016db1da0e350be", "ja": "へぇ……大人って感じの楽しみ方で、ステキですね♪\nじゃあ今日は、私も大人っぽさを意識してみようかな？", "zh": "哇……这种充满大人气息的享受方式，真不错呢♪\n那今天，我也试着展现出成熟的一面吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_8202_001har", "source_sha256": "e4c705205b8d2d6efad2874c1533eecdbf384c9ae2211dbee835c3046c73212c", "ja": "来る人がゆっくり楽しめる場所を提供する……みたいな\n感じで。普段と違う雰囲気を見せられて、いいかも♪", "zh": "提供一个让来的人可以慢慢享受的地方……大概是这种感觉吧。展现出和平时不同的氛围，或许也不错♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_8300_p", "source_sha256": "290fdfa65de883965607e0501f5c5c18078a32337fe119c29d84e022cf428670", "ja": "少し羽目を外しに、かも。ちょうどこの前も、\nストレス発散がてら楽しんできたよ！", "zh": "稍微放飞一下自我，之类的？正好前阵子，\n我也顺便借着释放压力去痛快玩了一趟呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_8301_001har", "source_sha256": "99c35e95afa8d37cc60f51443ee87498af1cbd3816b2c0dabba3abdf8a6a807c", "ja": "ス、ストレス……大丈夫ですか？　この前ってことは、\nなんだろ。あ、まさか！？　……って、ごめんなさい！", "zh": "压、压力……没事吧？你说前阵子，那是指……怎么说呢。啊，难道！？……对不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_8302_001har", "source_sha256": "a96204be9daaef225a4635fd27e142f685077e7c329c89f9a6f9da671c247c3e", "ja": "本当は、そういうことを聞きたかったわけじゃないん\nですけど、気になると撮影に集中できなさそうで……！", "zh": "其实我本来不是想问那些的，只是如果一直在意的话，好像就没法专心拍摄了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
